---
source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/progressive-retrieval.rs
expression: "stdout(&env, &listed)"
---
# instrukt docs index: snippet ids with their descriptions
# Filter with --domains <acme|beta>, --areas <principle|concept|policy|procedure|design|spec|adr>, --baseline-only, --third-party, --target <slug>, --project <slug>

acme/policy/rules: The rules of the work.
acme/procedure/work: How the work is done.

# Read the snippets you need: instrukt docs get <id> [<id>…]
# Pending documentation is flagged, never hidden: `(delivered by: <slugs>)` marks a snippet not yet delivered, `(superseded by: <slugs>)` a live snippet with pending changes. `instrukt docs get` reads the current contract; `--target <slug>` on `index` and `get` shows the documentation as that todo will deliver it.
